        "changed_files": [
          "shopkit/pagination.py"
        ],
        "summary": "Fixed shopkit/pagination.py.\n\n`paginate` treats page numbers as 1-indexed, but calculated the slice offset as if they were 0-indexed, skipping the first page. Restoring `(number - 1) * per_page` makes page 1 start at index 0.\n\nVerified: `41 passed` via the requested pytest command.",
        "diff": "diff --git a/shopkit/pagination.py b/shopkit/pagination.py\nindex 497e642..5810125 100644\n--- a/shopkit/pagination.py\n+++ b/shopkit/pagination.py\n@@ -55,7 +55,7 @@ def paginate(items: Sequence[T], number: int = 1, per_page: int = 10) -> Page:\n     if per_page < 1:\n         raise ValueError(f\"per_page must be at least 1, got {per_page}\")\n \n-    start = number * per_page\n+    start = (number - 1) * per_page\n     return Page(\n         items=tuple(items[start : start + per_page]),\n         number=number,\n"
      }
    },
